<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Biotechnology.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Biotechnology.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Texas Biotechnology Corp as a buy and set a $16 price target.</p>
<p>-- said the company has advanced its lead compound, Navastan, in two late-stage studies. Expects the results of these studies to be positive. Two other programs also recently advanced into Phase I clinical trials.</p>
<p>-- expects a corporate partnership to be announced in the second quarter of 1997 and perhaps another alliance in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Texas Biotechnology gained 1-5/16 to 5-5/16.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
